    "title": "RVR Bank promotes Coburn to Arlington branch manager - NewsBreak",
    "text": "thebestmix1055.com\nwebsite\nArlington\nRVR Bank promotes Coburn to Arlington branch manager\nBy Brent Wasenius,\n9 hours agoRVR Bank has announced the promotion of Crystal Coburn to Arlington office branch manager. A highly respected member of RVR Bank, Coburn brings a wealth of experience and a deep understanding of customer needs to her new leadership role. She initially joined the bank, then operating as Two Rivers Bank, in 2020 in a customer service capacity at the Arlington branch. Prior to that, she had already accumulated more than 17 years of experience in customer service and supervision, a foundation that has proven invaluable to the bank and its clientele.",
